  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Upload a raw MOF crystal structure (CIF), have a graph neural network remove free and/or bound solvent molecules, look at the cleaned framework and the removed solvent (with SMILES), and download the cleaned CIF. An optional check of activation stability is offered, but it failed in this deployment. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
